WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.480
Put 50 small animals in the
middle of a choice chamber,

2
00:00:03.530 --> 00:00:06.060
with a moist side and a dry side.

3
00:00:06.110 --> 00:00:09.800
After 10 minutes, count
them: 30 on the moist side,

4
00:00:09.850 --> 00:00:11.550
20 on the dry.

5
00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:13.660
Do they really prefer it moist?

6
00:00:13.710 --> 00:00:16.930
Or did they just happen to
scatter unevenly this time?

7
00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:20.020
How do biologists decide
whether a difference is real,

8
00:00:20.070 --> 00:00:21.480
or just luck?

9
00:00:21.530 --> 00:00:24.770
In this mission, you'll
start from a bold assumption:

10
00:00:24.820 --> 00:00:27.230
that there is no difference at all.

11
00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:31.310
Then you'll count daisies in a
trampled patch and an untouched one,

12
00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:33.450
and put the gap to the test.

13
00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:38.620
Your mission: find out how biologists
decide whether a difference is real or just

14
00:00:38.670 --> 00:00:39.240
luck.
